stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> scheduled: POST /schedule
  scheduled --> sending: worker claims (atomic UPDATE)
  scheduled --> rate_limited: hourly limit reached
  rate_limited --> sending: next window opens
  sending --> sent: SMTP accepted
  sending --> scheduled: transient error (network, 4xx), retried with backoff
  sending --> failed: permanent (5xx) or out of attempts
  sending --> failed: worker died mid-send (at-most-once)
  failed --> scheduled: user clicks Retry
  scheduled --> [*]: cancelled (DELETE)
  rate_limited --> [*]: cancelled (DELETE)
  sent --> [*]
